  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Reckless Savage Demon Venerable’s method activates for Fang Yuan, a voice names three immortal moves created from insights after reading “Pursuing Freedom” in The Legends of Ren Zu. The second move is Devouring Blue Leopard Transformation, and it uses mutation Gu as the core. The voice likens freedom to mutation Gu: it can make one better or worse, and a fierce beast without teeth may still devour food and grow stronger for it. The three monsters before Fang Yuan are transformed from those three killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        1956
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "gu_mutation_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To trigger the moves, the inheritor needs at least one of attitude Gu, mutation Gu, and adaptation Gu. Triggering all three lets them merge into incomplete freedom transformation.",
      "chapters": [
        1956
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_attitude_gu",
        "gu_adaptation_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Incomplete freedom transformation is made up of three moves: internal breathing green fish transformation, devouring blue leopard transformation, and thunder rush yellow bird transformation. After Zhan Bu Du uses incomplete freedom transformation, he gains the advantages of all three without their drawbacks.",
      "chapters": [
        2175
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "incomplete-freedom-set",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhan_bu_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later description of his fight strength again lists devouring blue leopard transformation among those three abilities.",
